@startuml
title W1 — SO27 / CO27 Add patient to waitlist
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
note over Staff, System
  Patient requested placement; staff is identified.
  No suitable open slot is available (checked by the system).
end note
Staff -> System : addPatientToWaitlist(patientNumber, medicalService,\nrequestedProfessional?, requestedSpecialty?, dateRange?, priority)
alt valid request; no equivalent active entry or suitable availability
  System --> Staff : waiting entry details and priority
else suitable open slot exists
  System --> Staff : available slots; return to UC1 booking
else unknown/incompatible input, invalid dates/priority, or duplicate
  System --> Staff : rejection reason (existing entry if duplicate)
end
note over System : No Appointment or clinical Referral is created.
@enduml
